    <briefdescription>
<para>Stateful Plugin Interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Optional interface for plugins that need state preservation during hot-reload. Plugins implementing this interface can save their state before unload and restore it after reload, enabling zero-downtime updates.</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: Implementations must be thread-safe </para>
    </detaileddescription>
